                  %em Uniform WKB, Multi-instantons, and Resurgent Trans-Series
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.5202"} arXiv:1401.5202
          %p A clear account:
          %ul
            %li
              M. V. Berry, C. J. Howls,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Hyperasymptotics for Integrals with Saddles
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/51890"} jstor:51890
          %p See p. 9 of https://arxiv.org/abs/1206.1890
          %p Review:
